{"id":"vod_sn_36590","vodId":"36590","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"数码宝贝大冒险 重启","name_cn":"数码宝贝大冒险 重启","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c89b99f60c459be0bc54a56eadb6430b.jpg"},"summary":"2020年，网络对于如今人们的生活而言已经是不可或缺的一部分。但是，人类所不知道的是，在网络的另一面有着一个无限的世界——数码世界，以及居住在其中的数码兽……以首都圈为中心发生了大规模网络故障，乱闪的信号灯、乱码的室外屏幕……新闻上报道是网络恐怖袭击。故事的主人公是住在东京近郊高层公寓的小学五年级生八神太一。为了准备周末的夏令营而一个人留在家中，去涩谷的母亲和妹妹八神光乘上了一辆无法停止的电车。为了救母亲和妹妹，太一急忙赶往涩谷，当他前往车站月台的瞬间发生了不可思议的现象，太一去了数码世界！孩子们与搭档数码兽相遇，一同面对未知的“冒险”！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":67,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TKD0tEP2vt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/69Bu29kZsj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nmWGff1u3J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YVFB3ETUBn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KMVNCJkeN41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r5S19qyqQC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TDbmRzj0b61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yrw0jfELDu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1bBffn7k211/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fcMwaCjpj11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PqJ4525rz81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tDkX056BsV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yz6cEv9wWv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uyYxXSHqTJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","ur